#. ja: ゴブリンマスク
#. de: Goblin-Gasmaske
#. fr: masque de Gobelin
#. column 2: goblin masks
#. column 8: A leather mask that filters out bad odors, as well as most poisonous gases. Due to its odd shape, only goblins can wear it.
#. column 9: Goblin Mask
msgctxt "Item:6000:0:0"
msgid "goblin mask"
msgstr "маска гоблина"

#. de: Goblin-Gasmasken
#. fr: masques de Gobelin
#. column 0: goblin mask
#. column 8: A leather mask that filters out bad odors, as well as most poisonous gases. Due to its odd shape, only goblins can wear it.
#. column 9: Goblin Mask
msgctxt "Item:6000:0:2"
msgid "goblin masks"
msgstr "маски гоблинов"

#. ja: ゴブリンが装着している防毒面
#. de: Diese Ledermaske filtert unangehme Gerüche und die meisten giftigen Gase. Wegen ihrer eigenartigen Form können sie nur Goblins anlegen.
#. fr: Un masque à gaz porté par les Gobelins.
#. column 0: goblin mask
#. column 2: goblin masks
#. column 9: Goblin Mask
msgctxt "Item:6000:0:8"
msgid "A leather mask that filters out bad odors, as well as most poisonous gases. Due to its odd shape, only goblins can wear it."
msgstr "Кожаная маска, защищающая от неприятных запахов и большинства ядовитых газов. Из-за необычной формы её могут носить только гоблины."

