msgstr "Маска гоблина"

#. ja: チョコボホイッスル
#. de: Chocobo-Pfeife
#. fr: sifflet chocobo
#. column 2: chocobo whistles
#. column 8: A small hand-carved whistle that emits a unique, high-pitched tone discernible only by a chocobo trained from birth to recognize and respond to the sound. Use to summon your personal chocobo.
#. column 9: Chocobo Whistle
msgctxt "Item:6001:0:0"
msgid "chocobo whistle"
msgstr "свисток чокобо"

#. de: Chocobo-Pfeifen
#. fr: sifflets chocobo
#. column 0: chocobo whistle
#. column 8: A small hand-carved whistle that emits a unique, high-pitched tone discernible only by a chocobo trained from birth to recognize and respond to the sound. Use to summon your personal chocobo.
#. column 9: Chocobo Whistle
msgctxt "Item:6001:0:2"
msgid "chocobo whistles"
msgstr "свистки чокобо"

#. ja: マウント修得<br>マイチョコボを呼び寄せるための小さな笛
#. de: Der hochfrequente Ton dieser kleinen, handgeschnitzten Pfeife kann nur von Chocobos wahrgenommen werden, die darauf trainiert wurden. Benutze die Pfeife, um deinen Chocobo herbeizurufen.
#. fr: [Monture]<br>Ce petit sifflet vous permet d'appeler votre chocobo personnel.
#. column 0: chocobo whistle
#. column 2: chocobo whistles
#. column 9: Chocobo Whistle
msgctxt "Item:6001:0:8"
msgid "A small hand-carved whistle that emits a unique, high-pitched tone discernible only by a chocobo trained from birth to recognize and respond to the sound. Use to summon your personal chocobo."
msgstr "Небольшой свисток ручной работы издаёт уникальный высокий звук. Его слышат только чокобо, которых с рождения приучили узнавать этот звук и откликаться на него. Используйте свисток, чтобы призвать своего чокобо."

#. ja: チョコボホイッスル
#. de: Chocobo-Pfeife
#. fr: Sifflet chocobo
#. column 0: chocobo whistle
#. column 2: chocobo whistles
#. column 8: A small hand-carved whistle that emits a unique, high-pitched tone discernible only by a chocobo trained from birth to recognize and respond to the sound. Use to summon your personal chocobo.
msgctxt "Item:6001:0:9"
msgid "Chocobo Whistle"
msgstr "Свисток чокобо"

#. ja: グゥーブーホルン
#. de: Goobbue-Horn
#. fr: cor goobbue
#. column 2: goobbue horns
#. column 8: This polished horn emits a deep, bellowing tone that creates subtle vibrations in the land that carry for malms. While undetectable by most, goobbues can sense these mini tremblors which they often mistake for mating calls.
#. column 9: Goobbue Horn
msgctxt "Item:6002:0:0"
msgid "goobbue horn"
msgstr "рог гоббу"

#. de: Goobbue-Hörner
#. fr: cors goobbue
#. column 0: goobbue horn
#. column 8: This polished horn emits a deep, bellowing tone that creates subtle vibrations in the land that carry for malms. While undetectable by most, goobbues can sense these mini tremblors which they often mistake for mating calls.
#. column 9: Goobbue Horn
msgctxt "Item:6002:0:2"
msgid "goobbue horns"
msgstr "рога гоббу"

#. ja: マウント修得<br>マイグゥーブーを呼び寄せるためのステキな角笛
#. de: Dieses polierte Horn erzeugt einen tiefen Ton, der als Vibration in der Erde mehrere Malme weit hinfortgetragen wird. Unhörbar für die eorzäischen Völker, so reagieren Goobbue jedoch auf den Ton, den sie fälschlicherweise für einen Balzruf halten.
#. fr: [Monture]<br>Cet élégant cor vous permet d'appeler votre goobbue.
#. column 0: goobbue horn
#. column 2: goobbue horns
#. column 9: Goobbue Horn
msgctxt "Item:6002:0:8"
msgid "This polished horn emits a deep, bellowing tone that creates subtle vibrations in the land that carry for malms. While undetectable by most, goobbues can sense these mini tremblors which they often mistake for mating calls."
msgstr "Отполированный рог издаёт низкий гул, который вызывает едва заметные колебания земли. Они разносятся на многие мили. Большинство их не замечает, зато гоббу чувствуют — и часто принимают за брачный зов."

#. ja: グゥーブーホルン
#. de: Goobbue-Horn
#. fr: Cor goobbue
#. column 0: goobbue horn
#. column 2: goobbue horns
#. column 8: This polished horn emits a deep, bellowing tone that creates subtle vibrations in the land that carry for malms. While undetectable by most, goobbues can sense these mini tremblors which they often mistake for mating calls.
msgctxt "Item:6002:0:9"
msgid "Goobbue Horn"
msgstr "Рог гоббу"

#. ja: タイニーボム
#. de: Kirschbomber-Pfeife
#. fr: bombino
#. column 2: cherry bombs
#. column 8: Summons a miniature recreation of a voidsent bomb, created via the thaumaturgical rendering of umbrally charged aetherial energy. Guaranteed never to self-destruct, or your gil back.<br><br>Use item to acquire the cherry bomb minion.
#. column 9: Cherry Bomb
msgctxt "Item:6003:0:0"
msgid "cherry bomb"
msgstr "вишнёвая бомба"

