#. ja: 幻想薬
#. de: Phiole[p] Fantasia
#. fr: bouteille de philtre d'illusion
#. column 2: phials of Fantasia
#. column 8: Legend states that any who drink this mysterious liquid before lying down for the evening will awaken a new man (or woman).<br><br>Grants you an opportunity to edit your appearance in the character creation screen upon your next login. Once logged in with a new appearance, you may continue to re-edit within a set period of time.
#. column 9: Fantasia
msgctxt "Item:6221:0:0"
msgid "phial of Fantasia"
msgstr "флакон «Фантазия»"

#. de: Phiolen[p] Fantasia
